K = 1048576, N = 64: 1 <= M <= K (N/2 - 1) = 32505856; the label bound Q M amount <= 2^62 - 1
K = 4096, N = 64: 1 <= M <= K (N/2 - 1) = 126976; the label bound Q M amount <= 2^62 - 1
